  "explanation": "The question asks 'When was the Sumter County Courthouse built?' and does not specify a state, so we must consider all distinct referents:\n\n1. **1902** refers to the **Sumter County Courthouse in Alabama**, supported by D1S2, D2S1, D2S2, D3S7.\n2. **1912-1914** refers to the **Sumter County Courthouse in Florida**, supported by D5S1.\n3. **1907** refers to the **Sumter County Courthouse in South Carolina**, supported by D7S1.\n\nThe **1850** claim (from D4S5) appears to describe a different courthouse or possibly a prior iteration of the same building in Alabama, but it is contradicted by the more specific and consistent references to the 1902 construction in the same state. Therefore, it is removed as irrelevant or contradictory to the current primary structure."
